  m_text: "<size=100> HGD Survivor\r </size>\n\r\n\n<size=85>Main Staff\r</size>\n\r\nExecutive
    Producer - Hanseo Cho\r\n\r\nLead Programmer - Yir Kim\r\n\r\nArtwork - Hanseo
    Cho\r\n\r\nSound Director - Hanseo Cho\r\n\r\n\n<size=85>Tools & Licenses\r</size>\n\r\nMade
    with Aseprite & Unity\r\n\r\nFont\r\n\r\nPixel Art Serif Font 900+ characters
    by Reff Pixels\r\n\n<size=40>\uAC08\uBB34\uB9AC</size>9 by Minseo Lee\r\n\r \nArt
    - GameDev Market\r\n\r\n2D Pixel - RPG Icon Pack\r\n\r\nAdmurin's Items Mega
    Pack A\r\n\r\nMonster Mega Pack\r\n\r\npixel_animations_gfxpack\r\n\r\nSummerwind
    Saga - Mountains and Winter Mountains\r\n\r\nSummerwind Sage - Grasslands 4 Seasons\r\n\r\nSound
    effects - Unity Asset Store \r\n\r\nBlasters\r\n\r\nCombatMagicSpellsVII\r\n\r\nDestruction
    demolition\r\n\r\nEverything Bundle SFX 2024\r\n\r\nMedieval Fantasy SFX Bundle\r\n\r\nMelee
    Weapons Pack 1\r\n\r\nRPG Magic Sound Effects Pack 3 [ELEMENTAL]\r\n\r\nBGM -
    Unity Asset Store \r\n\r\nFantasy Music Starter Pack - Orchestral Music\n\r\nUltimate
    Game Music Collection\r\n\r\nFantasy Medieval Combat\r\n\r\nBoss Battles, Combat
    & Stingers \n- Epic Adventure/Action Music\r\n\r\nLUShvalleySound: Fantasy BGM
    \u2013 Free Pack Vol.01\r\n\r\n\n<size=80>Special thanks to Sungwoo Cho</size>\r\n\r\n\n\n\nand..\r\n\r\n\n\n\n\n<size=120>
